OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry  
OL,6,Fovernight with long clear spells       
OL,7,Fdeveloping. Turning cold with a fairly 
OL,8,Fwidespread frost developing, along     
OL,9,Fwith some patches of mist or fog in    
OL,10,Fprone spots.                           
OL,12,CMonday:FAny early mist or fog clearing 
OL,13,Fto leave a largely dry and bright day  
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells. Remaining rather    
OL,15,Fchilly with generally light winds.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
